      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Folhinha. A carapaça de Turtwig é feita de terra. Quando está úmida, isso indica que ele está saudável. Ele realiza fotossíntese por todo o corpo, fazendo sua carapaça ficar cada vez mais rígida.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Grama, Monstro &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 88% M / 12% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Turtwig pode evoluir para Grotle no nível 6 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Withdraw</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Absorb</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Razor Leaf</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Curse</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Bite</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Mega Drain</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Leech Seed</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Synthesis</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Crunch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Giga Drain</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Leaf Storm</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Amnesia, Attract, Body Slam, Bulldoze, Bullet Seed, Confide, Crunch, Curse, Double Team, Double-Edge, Earth Power, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, Frustration, Giga Drain, Grass Knot, Grass Pledge, Grassy Glide, Grassy Terrain, Heavy Slam, Hidden Power, Iron Head, Iron Tail, Leaf Storm, Light Screen, Magical Leaf, Mud Shot, Mud-Slap, Nature Power, Protect, Reflect, Rest, Return, Roar, Rock Smash, Round, Safeguard, Sand Tomb, Seed Bomb, Sleep Talk, Smack Down, Snore, Solar Beam, Stealth Rock, Substitute, Sunny Day, Superpower, Swagger, Swords Dance, Synthesis, Take Down, Tera Blast, Toxic, Trailblaze, Work Up, Worry Seed, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Amnesia, Body Slam, Double-Edge, Earth Power, Grassy Terrain, Growth, Heavy Slam, Sand Tomb, Seed Bomb, Shell Smash, Spit U p, S tockpile, Superpower, Swallow, Thrash, Tickle, Wide Guard, Worry Se e d</p>",
